<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
  <h2>New Assessment Submission</h2>
  <p><strong>Name:</strong> {{name}}</p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
  <p><strong>Mobile:</strong> {{mobile}}</p>
  <p><strong>Total Score:</strong> {{score}}</p>

  <h3>Assessment Details:</h3>
  <table border="1" cellpadding="10" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Question</th>
        <th>Answer</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>1. Do you average your positions while trading options?</td><td>{{q1}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2. Do you make buy or sell decisions in a stock mainly based on news?</td><td>{{q2}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3. If you buy a stock for swing trading and it starts going down, do you remove or ignore your stop-loss and convert your position into an investment?</td><td>{{q3}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>4. Do you often take full losses but book profits very early?</td><td>{{q4}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>5. Do you have proper knowledge but still do not stick to your setups or strategy?</td><td>{{q5}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>6. Do you feel that the trades you only think about hit the target, but the trades you actually take end in a loss?</td><td>{{q6}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>7. Even after making the right decision in the market, do you still end up booking the trade at a loss?</td><td>{{q7}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>8. Do you check the market repeatedly at night?</td><td>{{q8}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>9. Do you keep checking your trades or portfolio repeatedly after taking a trade or building a portfolio?</td><td>{{q9}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>10. Do you make fast decisions after watching news on TV?</td><td>{{q10}}</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</body>
</html>